1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
I designed the form to guide users
before they create a proxy list.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:07,000
The app checks required fields
before sending a generation request.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,500
If the password is missing,
a clear message explains what to enter.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:18,800
If the user ID is missing,
the page moves back to that field.

5
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:24,500
Connection at a glance updates
as the user changes the settings.

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Users can check the protocol, session, quantity
and location before generation.

7
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,625
After success, the page moves to Your proxy list
and confirms completion.

8
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:42,625
I mask the middle of the password in the preview.
This helps reduce accidental exposure on screen.

9
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:45,625
Generated configuration shows
the settings used for this list.
